{"id": "EUVD-2026-86896", "enisaUuid": "a804985c-7640-3c31-9962-95f6ded9f660", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ns390/crypto: Map EBUSY to EIO when key conversion fails repeatedly\n\nWhen hardware persistently returns -EBUSY after exhausting retries,\nthe error propagates to crypto_finalize_*_request(). The crypto API's\ncompletion wrapper treats -EBUSY as a queueing status and swallows it,\npreventing the completion callback from firing. This causes callers\nusing crypto_wait_req() to block indefinitely.\n\nTranslate persistent -EBUSY to -EIO after retry exhaustion to ensure\nproper error propagation and callback invocation.", "datePublished": "2026-09-25T10:22:06", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:09:52", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f6b263679aa72ad2e534bf93db55f2589549a40e", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e267bd142664a181474112392aeaa8b3d4b12f2e", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7a08507ea5b4d06ad8d269287913573f34467565"], "aliases": ["GHSA-h4f3-gqwc-8q2q", "CVE-2026-97588"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "021f99b9-e21c-3bac-8728-4c687ca911e5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6cd87cb5ef6ca50ae17c371482ceaab1d635e232 <f6b263679aa72ad2e534bf93db55f2589549a40e"}, {"id": "08a587ae-75ce-305c-8bc4-f2e09269d58c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.53"}, {"id": "3862d78f-9eb3-32c1-9b46-1050ba64455d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.16"}, {"id": "59b0ba3c-ab86-34d8-9e02-5db3e30c09a9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6cd87cb5ef6ca50ae17c371482ceaab1d635e232 <7a08507ea5b4d06ad8d269287913573f34467565"}, {"id": "9f34ac71-7048-3366-a4bc-347c2740ecd8", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "ba6ca634-30af-3ce8-acd1-abb45aeb284f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "bf41bfbf-13f6-3532-be59-b94219d262c1", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.7"}, {"id": "cb3a56b7-ed7b-3c97-9139-41b6dd7cd9b7", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6cd87cb5ef6ca50ae17c371482ceaab1d635e232 <e267bd142664a181474112392aeaa8b3d4b12f2e"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "ed0cc761-1bea-35ee-90da-b1e6deb3fc04", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}